# Google Places API — live rating & reviews (optional)
#
# When both variables are set, the home page rating badge, the "Happy Reviews"
# and "Google Rating" stats, and the reviews section pull live data from Google
# and refresh automatically. If they are absent, the site falls back to the
# curated rating and reviews. Keep the API key server-side only — never commit
# real values.
#
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY: a Google Places API (New) key with "Places API (New)" enabled.
# GOOGLE_PLACES_ID: the Google Place ID for Brookswood Automotive / Fareham MOT Centre.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACES_ID=
